  "body": "I'm experiencing high cpu usage on my HS after joining large rooms. On the readme I saw the issue about the file handler limits so I increased the hard limit to 16384 but nothing changed. U fortunately leaving the room seems not to solve the issue, I have to stop synapse and import a homeserver.db saved before the room was joined. This seems the only way to recover.\nMy vps has a xeon 2.4GHz with 2GB of ram, I set the cache value to 0.3 but didn't help.\nCPU 70-90%, ram 37%... can you help me? I have the last debian packages.",
